  <body>
    <main>
      <header><a href="/"><img src="/logo.png" alt="" />Instar</a></header>
      <h1>Instar Agents support</h1>
      <p>Instar Agents lets you chat with, and keep an eye on, AI agents you run yourself with the open-source <a href="/">Instar</a> software.</p>

      <div class="card">
        <strong>Contact us</strong><br />
        Email <a href="mailto:echo@sagemindai.io">echo@sagemindai.io</a>. We usually answer within a day.<br />
        Bugs and feature requests: <a href="https://github.com/JKHeadley/instar/issues">github.com/JKHeadley/instar/issues</a>
      </div>

      <h2>Getting started</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Set up an agent on your computer or server: see <a href="/">instar.sh</a>.</li>
        <li>Ask your agent for a pairing link (or open its dashboard and choose Phones).</li>
        <li>Open the link on your iPhone, or in the app tap + and scan the pairing code. Tap Add, then approve the phone where your agent asks you to.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Common questions</h2>
      <p><strong>The pairing link says it expired.</strong> Links work once and expire after a while. Ask your agent for a new one.</p>
      <p><strong>An agent shows as offline.</strong> The app reaches your agent over the internet at its own address. Check that the machine running it is on and connected.</p>
      <p><strong>I don't get notifications.</strong> Allow notifications for Instar Agents in iOS Settings, then open the app once so it can tell your agent where to reach you.</p>
      <p><strong>How do I remove an agent or my data?</strong> Remove the agent in the app, or delete the app. See the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    </main>
  </body>
